cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite it as below. The harness code is MIT and the measurement
  records are CC0; see LICENSE, LICENSE-DATA and NOTICE for what each covers.
title: "Qwen3.8-27B speculative decoding on a single RTX 3090"
abstract: >-
  A preregistered, paired and interleaved benchmark of llama.cpp's draft-mtp and draft-dflash
  speculative decoding on one RTX 3090, with the hypotheses and analysis plan committed before
  Phase A data collection. Ships the per-request measurement records, the analysis harness that
  produced every reported figure, and a dated log of every correction and withdrawal, including
  the hypotheses that were not supported.
type: software
authors:
